    "title": "Using data to reach more California homebuyers",
    "excerpt": "<p>The Office of Data and Innovation (ODI) and the California Housing Finance Authority (CalHFA) combined many data sources to learn if their marketing efforts helped people buy homes. Project scope Partner Methods The opportunity CalHFA helps Californians buy homes by offering down payment assistance. The agency focuses on reaching people who have had less access &#8230; <a title=\"Using data to reach more California homebuyers\" class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://live-digital-ca-gov.pantheonsite.io/our-work/projects/using-data-reach-more-california-homebuyers/\" aria-label=\"More on Using data to reach more California homebuyers\">Read more</a></p>\n",
